{"id": "1801690", "name": "חקירת פונקציה – מנה של פונקציה מעריכית וליניארית", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "functions": [{"name": "ff", "params": ["x"], "body": "(%e^(aa*x))/(bb*x+cc)"}], "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; line-height: 1.55; text-align: right;\" title=\"BGU_STACK_Q3396485_EXTREMA_FUNCTIONSTUDY_V6_VISIBLE_VALIDATION\">\n<div style=\"background: #f4f1f5; border: 1px solid #d9d1dd; border-radius: 10px; padding: 11px 14px; margin-bottom: 10px;\"><strong style=\"font-size: 20px; color: #4b1f6f;\">חקירת פונקציה – מנה של פונקציה מעריכית וליניארית</strong></div>\n<div style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #ddd; border-radius: 9px; padding: 11px; margin: 8px 0;\"><strong style=\"color: #4b1f6f;\">הפונקציה</strong>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\\(\\displaystyle f\\left(x\\right)={{CT:0}}\\)</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #ddd; border-radius: 9px; padding: 11px; margin: 8px 0;\"><strong style=\"color: #4b1f6f;\">תחום ונקודה קריטית</strong>\n<p>מצאו את נקודת אי־ההגדרה ואת הנקודה שבה הנגזרת מתאפסת.</p>\n<table style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; margin: 6px 0;\">\\(\\displaystyle x_1=\\) [[input:ans1]]</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #666;\">[[validation:ans1]]</div>\n</td>\n<td>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; margin: 6px 0;\">\\(\\displaystyle x_0=\\) [[input:ans2]]</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #666;\">[[validation:ans2]]</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #ddd; border-radius: 9px; padding: 11px; margin: 8px 0;\"><strong style=\"color: #4b1f6f;\">סיווג</strong>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">[[input:ans3]]</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #ddd; border-radius: 9px; padding: 11px; margin: 8px 0;\"><strong style=\"color: #4b1f6f;\">גבולות ליד האסימפטוטה</strong>\n<table style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; margin: 6px 0;\">\\(\\displaystyle \\lim_{x\\to x_1^+}f\\left(x\\right)=\\) [[input:ans4]]</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #666;\">[[validation:ans4]]</div>\n</td>\n<td>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; margin: 6px 0;\">\\(\\displaystyle \\lim_{x\\to x_1^-}f\\left(x\\right)=\\) [[input:ans5]]</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #666;\">[[validation:ans5]]</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #ddd; border-radius: 9px; padding: 11px; margin: 8px 0;\"><strong style=\"color: #4b1f6f;\">התנהגות באינסוף</strong>\n<table style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; margin: 6px 0;\">\\(\\displaystyle \\lim_{x\\to\\infty}f\\left(x\\right)=\\) [[input:ans6]]</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #666;\">[[validation:ans6]]</div>\n</td>\n<td>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; margin: 6px 0;\">\\(\\displaystyle \\lim_{x\\to-\\infty}f\\left(x\\right)=\\) [[input:ans7]]</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #666;\">[[validation:ans7]]</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #ddd; border-radius: 9px; padding: 11px; margin: 8px 0;\"><strong style=\"color: #4b1f6f;\">בחרו את הגרף</strong>\n<table style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>גרף 1<br>{{CT:1}}</td>\n<td>גרף 2<br>{{CT:2}}</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>גרף 3<br>{{CT:3}}</td>\n<td>גרף 4<br>{{CT:4}}</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;